# Cargo/build-wrapper output. The orchestrator crate builds into
# dut/env/orchestrator/target/, and the remote-build wrapper writes its lock and
# logs into a target/ at the repo root; neither is source.
target/

# The vsomeip build scratch: a git worktree of third_party/vsomeip at its pinned
# commit, stood up by scripts/setup-vsomeip.sh, which resets and patches it on
# every run. It is derived from the submodule and rebuilt from it, so it is not
# source; ignoring it is also what keeps it from travelling to a build machine
# (docs/tech-debt.md TD-50).
/.vsomeip-src/
